# =============================================
# Large binaries and tools (not needed in repo)
# FFmpeg binaries are large (~80-150MB) and excluded from version control.
# Each developer must install FFmpeg locally for the Shadowing feature.
# The README.md inside the folder is kept so users know what to do.
# =============================================
midori-be/ffmpeg-8.1.2-full_build/
!midori-be/ffmpeg-8.1.2-full_build/README.md

